{"3507110": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Vinyl Desktop", "steam_appid": 3507110, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rediscover the magic of vinyl!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vinyl Desktop is an <strong>audio player</strong> designed for Hi-Fi enthusiasts, audiophiles and vinyl lovers. It offers the most <strong>realistic and authentic</strong> simulation of a vinyl turntable right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply <strong>drag and drop</strong> audio files onto the turntable to load your music, then place the needle on the record to begin playback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507110/extras/63f0dd5ccfb50dacf0ebee6e3320e577.poster.avif?t=1778663404\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507110/extras/63f0dd5ccfb50dacf0ebee6e3320e577.webm?t=1778663404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507110/extras/63f0dd5ccfb50dacf0ebee6e3320e577.mp4?t=1778663404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The record player's window is <strong>always on top</strong>, and can be easily <strong>resized</strong> or <strong>positioned to anywhere on the desktop</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507110/extras/cd842a5c6d094d7b6f2b0dd1916d6611.poster.avif?t=1778663404\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507110/extras/cd842a5c6d094d7b6f2b0dd1916d6611.webm?t=1778663404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507110/extras/cd842a5c6d094d7b6f2b0dd1916d6611.mp4?t=1778663404\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully functional and interactive 3D turntable based on the iconic SL-1200 series</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pitch control from -8 to +8 %</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vinyl records with cover art and grooves that match track structure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Support for all common audio file formats: mp3, flac, wav, ogg, aif and wma </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >32-bit floating point audio engine</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u>Does not include any music and streaming services are not supported!</u></strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rediscover the magic of vinyl!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vinyl Desktop is an <strong>audio player</strong> designed for Hi-Fi enthusiasts, audiophiles and vinyl lovers. It offers the most <strong>realistic and authentic</strong> simulation of a vinyl turntable right on your desktop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simply <strong>drag and drop</strong> audio files onto the turntable to load your music, then place the needle on the record to begin playback.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507110/extras/63f0dd5ccfb50dacf0ebee6e3320e577.poster.avif?t=1778663404\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3507110/extras/63f0dd5ccfb50dacf0ebee6e3320e577.webm?t=1778663404\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst